WEBVTT

00:03:28.454 --> 00:03:31.582
“Fossil Necklace” speaks
to our long continuum.

00:03:33.584 --> 00:03:35.586
Every day we walk past trees,

00:03:35.586 --> 00:03:38.339
but do we stop to think
that they are our cousins?

00:03:38.798 --> 00:03:41.968
We share so many of our genes with trees,

00:03:41.968 --> 00:03:44.136
and forests give us our breath.

00:03:44.679 --> 00:03:46.180
I wanted to honor them

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:50.184
by creating a sculpture
made of every tree type on Earth.

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:52.186
This is “Hollow.”

00:03:52.937 --> 00:03:55.439
Designed with architects Zeller &amp; Moye,

00:03:55.439 --> 00:03:58.901
it brings together
over 10,000 tree species

00:03:58.901 --> 00:04:00.611
spanning millions of years.